h", "link": 50, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 51, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "label": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "upscale_method"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_proportion"}, "name": "keep_proportion", "label": "keep_proportion", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keep_proportion"}, {"widget": {"name": "pad_color"}, "name": "pad_color", "label": "pad_color", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "pad_color"}, {"widget": {"name": "crop_position"}, "name": "crop_position", "label": "crop_position", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "crop_position"}, {"widget": {"name": "divisible_by"}, "name": "divisible_by", "label": "divisible_by", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "divisible_by"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "id": 340, "type": "ImageResizeKJv2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageResizeKJv2"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [38], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "LATENT", "links": [36], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [550.7059936523438, 848.6327514648438], "pos": [937.0511474609375, 124.68531799316406], "widgets_values": ["资产角色：\n<Picture 1>\n年轻女性异能者，黑色蓬松短卷发，五官冷冽精致，双耳佩戴发光蓝色水滴形耳坠；身着白色圆领短袖T恤与浅蓝色修身牛仔裤，穿搭日常干练，掌握蓝色能量异能，为战斗主角。\n\n一个低机位中全景镜头框住女主。镜头以稳定向前推近伴随轻微震动开场，女主立于幽暗雾气巷道，缓步前行，黑短发与衣摆随气流微动，蓝水滴耳坠持续散发冷辉，指尖萦绕细碎蓝能粒子。\nthe camera cuts to 侧面高速跟拍，数道黑影从两侧阴影突袭，女主骤然停步侧身闪避，手肘硬接利爪攻击，衣料瞬间绷紧，蓝色能量沿手臂迸发，震开来袭敌军。\nthe shot transitions to 近景侧切，女主旋腰沉肩出拳，蓝能包裹拳锋，正面击中敌军胸口，敌军倒飞撞墙，墙体凹陷蔓延蛛网裂纹，镜头随冲击力小幅后拉。\nthe camera cuts to 广角仰拍拉升，女主蹬地腾空跃起，身后拖出淡蓝残像，空中敌军合围包抄，女主拧身横扫腿，弧状蓝能扫过敌群，镜头向上拉升展开空战格局。\nthe shot changes to 垂直俯冲跟拍，女主借力向下俯冲，掌心凝聚连发能量弹，连续轰击地面敌军，落点接连炸开蓝焰碎石，尘浪翻涌，镜头垂直俯冲追随轨迹。\nthe camera dynamically follows 女主落地滑铲侧身，擦过敌方能量刃，地面擦出火星划痕，滑至敌身侧起身反手肘击，蓝能爆开掀飞敌军撞向立柱，镜头贴地全程跟拍。\nthe shot transitions to 360度高速环绕中景，女主站定撑开蓝色能量屏障，多道敌方攻击同时命中，屏障表面泛起环形能量波纹，爬满亮蓝纹路，镜头环绕强化对峙张力。\nthe camera cuts to 正面极速推拉特写，女主眸光骤凝，屏障瞬间向外爆发扩散，冲击波掀飞周遭敌军，衣发反向狂舞，耳坠蓝光攀升鼎盛，画面伴随强光震颤。\nthe shot changes to 侧方贴地跟拍，女主乘势超音速突进，身后拖出连贯蓝色残影，脚下地面因冲力接连碎裂，碎石向后高速喷射，镜头紧追冲刺动线。\nthe camera cuts to 短时子弹时间慢镜，女主冲至敌军首领身前，握拳压缩高密度蓝能，拳锋周边空间轻微扭曲，发丝衣料细节根根分明，定格蓄力临界点。\nthe shot transitions to 全景侧拉，女主一拳轰出，巨型蓝色能量柱贯穿敌军首领，能量向四周剧烈扩散，光粒烟尘席卷巷道，墙面灼出能量蚀痕，镜头后拉展现冲击规模。\nthe shot changes to 收势慢镜中景，女主缓缓收拳直立，能量余波徐徐消散，短发衣摆渐渐回落，耳坠蓝光趋于平稳，抬眼望向巷道深处，定格冷冽戒备姿态。\noverall_soundscape: Misty urban alley hums with low ambient tension, glowing blue energy crackles and pulses from earrings and fist strikes. Fists impact bodies with heavy thuds, concrete shatters with deep cracks, debris scatters, and supersonic dashes whip wind sharply. Energy barriers resonate with deep hums before exploding outward in roaring shockwaves.non_diegetic_music: Fast-paced synth-driven combat score with punchy electronic beats, deep bass drops, and sharp string layers, building steadily in intensity and holding on the final pose with a tense, lingering note.", 1344, 768, 124], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 43, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 44, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 45, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 40, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 41, "label": "height", "type": 